      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngikapolok lu edwangi Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apot sek Ngisirael toremo akwap na ayei kide Yorudan, tolemasi napei anadipo a Arinon tanang nadipo a Yorudan. Ani alowae alo alokwap, tanang moru a Erimon. Kidwanga kesi ngikapolok ngiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arai epei Sion, lo arai ekapolon a Ngiamor lo apolokinit Echibon. Apolokinit ngesi tani epewae a akwap a Gilead napei alo Aroer (ani eyei lokukuoru a adipo a Arinon) ka ere lo eyei kiding adipo ngina, tanang nangolol a Yabok, ni etiakaror Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anangit ni apolokinit ngesi nadipo a Yorudan, alowae alo eyei kwap anam a Galilaya, tanang Bes Yechimos (Kide anam a Amakat) kiriwor jik tanang nakeju a emoru a Pisiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apot nabo kesi kidwanga Ogu lo arai ekapolon a Bachan, lo arai epei a ngikapolok alu esal a ngitunga alulangir kooyak anyaritae Ngirepai. Apolokinit ngesi Achitaros ka Edirei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ekim 21:21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Etal 2:26–3:11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Apolokinit napei alomoru a Erimon, ka Saleka ta akwap a Bachan daang, tanang lokukuoru a akwap a Gechur ka Maaka ta epewae a Gilead ni esalunitor akwap a ekapolon alo anyaritae Sion alo arai ekapolon a akwap a Echibon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
